<title>USA: Autologic names Doolittle president.</title>
<headline>Autologic names Doolittle president.</headline>
<dateline>THOUSAND OAKS, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Autologic Information International Inc said Dennis Doolittle was elected president of the company, following the resignation of Alden Edwards.</p>
<p>Doolittle's responsibilities as president will be in addition to his present role as vice chairman and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Edwards, the company noted, will remain on the board of directors and will be an advisor.</p>
